<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>retroarch-nightly</id>
    <title>RetroArch (Nightly)</title>
    <version>2024.08.06</version>
    <authors>Libretro</authors>
    <owners>fpscan, Gadsby</owners>
    <summary>RetroArch is the official reference frontend for the libretro API (Nightly Builds).</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[RetroArch is a frontend for libretro, an open API which exposes the functionality of a game, emulator or certain kinds of multimedia applications. RetroArch builds around the libretro API to provide a powerful interface for libretro cores.

This package tracks bleeding-edge nightly builds from the Libretro buildbot.

## Package Parameters

The following package parameters can be set:

* `/InstallDir:{path}` - Installation base directory, defaults to `{tools-location}` (typically `C:\tools`)
* `/InstallationPath:{path}` - Alias for `/InstallDir`
* `/DesktopShortcut` - Add shortcut for RetroArch Nightly to the desktop.
* `/NoStartMenuShortcut` - Do not create a shortcut in the Start Menu (created by default).

Example: `choco install retroarch-nightly --params '"/DesktopShortcut /InstallDir:C:\RetroArchNightly"'`

## Notes

* RetroArch installs into its own `RetroArch-Win64` (or `RetroArch-Win32`) directory within the installation directory.
* Shims are created for `retroarch.exe` and `retroarch_debug.exe` with GUI support enabled (`-UseStart`), allowing command-line launching without holding open a background terminal.
* Nightly builds may contain experimental features and potential regressions.
]]></description>
    <projectUrl>https://www.retroarch.com/</projectUrl>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/fpscan/chocolatey-packages/</packageSourceUrl>
